{"type": "assistant", "message": {"id": "msg_1785853552223", "type": "message", "role": "assistant", "content": [{"type": "text", "text": "非常关键的发现。有三篇密切相关的论文使用了基于 HMM/Markov-switching 的方法进行 AAD 后处理——这正是 SGAD 所做的，但使用的是 attention 机制而不是 HMM。让我来检查一下它们之间的距离。"}], "model": "GLM-5.2-w4a8", "stop_reason": null, "stop_sequence": null, "usage": {"input_tokens": 0, "output_tokens": 0, "cache_creation_input_tokens": 0, "cache_read_input_tokens": 0}, "context_management": null}, "parent_tool_use_id": null, "session_id": "c54c7704-7c55-4ef9-b6d2-c3ba122c790b", "uuid": "f5efa0b1-f511-40ed-ae4f-9f9ae367c365"}
